**Regression filters, unchanged from the accepted driver**
(`.temp/TASK-260720-2284br/gates-cycle5/run-gates.sh:35-41` defines `$R5`, `$REVALIDATION`,
`$CONCURRENCY`, `$ACTIVATION` verbatim; reuse them literally):

